That's why I want her to build up her
confidence until she has the will to ask

230
00:18:19,389 --> 00:18:21,725
him out on her own.

231
00:18:25,270 --> 00:18:30,150
Wouldn't it suck? When you're both
supposed to like each other, and one

232
00:18:30,234 --> 00:18:35,114
person thinks the other is
just with them out of pity.

233
00:18:36,532 --> 00:18:37,366
Yeah.

234
00:18:38,867 --> 00:18:42,454
I guess if you think about it, even if
we did end up telling Sawako that Kazehaya

235
00:18:42,538 --> 00:18:46,125
likes her, I'm pretty sure
she'd never believe us anyway.

236
00:18:46,208 --> 00:18:49,795
They're being so
considerate of my feelings.

237
00:18:49,878 --> 00:18:51,380
That's true.

238
00:18:55,217 --> 00:18:59,012
But that doesn't change
what I said... yesterday.

239
00:19:01,265 --> 00:19:05,727
Oh, if we're talking about Sawako... Well,
of course you don't understand her in that

240
00:19:05,811 --> 00:19:10,315
aspect, you might be
the furthest from her.

241
00:19:12,276 --> 00:19:15,696
The one who didn't understand... was me!

242
00:19:15,779 --> 00:19:19,741
So anyway, you were saying
something about him yesterday?

243
00:19:20,033 --> 00:19:24,246
A-About who? I didn't say anything
about Kazehaya-who? I mean, what?

244
00:19:24,329 --> 00:19:29,710
Crap! I gotta do something about
this fast or Yano-chin's gonna kill me!

245
00:19:29,793 --> 00:19:33,046
You went to the cursed lecture?

246
00:19:33,130 --> 00:19:34,464
How was it?

247
00:19:34,548 --> 00:19:35,966
It was insane, dude!

248
00:19:36,049 --> 00:19:38,468
Uh-huh! The rumors were true!

249
00:19:38,552 --> 00:19:42,139
If I were to give an example... let me see...
It's kinda like losing 5 kilos within 3

250
00:19:42,222 --> 00:19:46,185
- days! Yeah, like that!
- S-Say what?!

251
00:19:48,187 --> 00:19:50,772
Th- That sounds like
some kind of disease! Oh no!

252
00:19:50,856 --> 00:19:53,317
Sadako's amazing, huh?!

253
00:19:55,194 --> 00:19:59,907
- Hey they're complimenting you!
- Sada...

254
00:20:11,793 --> 00:20:12,794
Awesome!

255
00:20:13,378 --> 00:20:16,089
You're seriously incredible, Sadako!

256
00:20:17,883 --> 00:20:20,010
- Can you do it again?
- Can I get a passing score in 3 days too?

257
00:20:20,093 --> 00:20:21,845
I want in too!

258
00:20:22,221 --> 00:20:23,222
You see?

259
00:20:23,555 --> 00:20:27,559
Have some more faith in yourself.

260
00:20:29,019 --> 00:20:29,853
Hey, Sadako.

261
00:20:30,646 --> 00:20:34,274
- Thanks so much for yesterday.
- No! It was my pleasure!

262
00:20:37,277 --> 00:20:40,530
By the way, I was wondering, that plant
you gave me the other day where'd you get

263
00:20:40,614 --> 00:20:43,700
- it?
- That was a medicinal herb that

264
00:20:43,784 --> 00:20:45,535
- I'm growing in the flower beds.
- Seriously?

265
00:20:45,619 --> 00:20:47,496
Here at school?

266
00:20:47,621 --> 00:20:50,832
Yes! I carefully selected a
mixture of herbs with various benefits...

267
00:20:50,916 --> 00:20:54,169
Well, it really made a huge difference.

268
00:20:57,339 --> 00:21:00,550
Just saying, it's going to lead to more
jealousy, which will lead to her being

269
00:21:00,634 --> 00:21:02,386
more isolated.

270
00:21:06,306 --> 00:21:07,599
I don't get it.

271
00:22:27,262 --> 00:22:29,639
He's the only person...

272
00:22:29,723 --> 00:22:31,475
My eyes keep avoiding.

273
00:22:32,893 --> 00:22:35,520
Next time: "The Person That I Like"
